# Vivaldi, La primavera / Spring, Op. 8 No. 1, RV 269, first movement (Allegro, E major).
# The notes are the Mutopia Project's (examples/scores/rv269-spring.mid,
# CC BY-SA 3.0, see examples/scores/LICENSE.txt), imported as they are.
# Spring in the style of Switched-On Bach: a Minimoog sings the solo,
# an ARP 2600 bows the first violins, a CS-15 and an SH-101 the inner
# parts, and a Minimoog bass plays the cello.
tempo 115
swing 50

track solo synth Minimoog MiniLead
track violin1 synth Arp2600 BowedString
track violin2 synth Cs15 Cs15Strings
track viola synth Sh101 Sh101Strings
track cello synth Minimoog MiniBass
strip solo: Level 0.69, Pan 0.0, Send2 0.25
strip violin1: Level 0.83, Pan -0.45, Send2 0.35
strip violin2: Level 0.31, Pan 0.45, Send2 0.35
strip viola: Level 0.44, Pan 0.2, Send2 0.35
strip cello: Level 0.41, Pan -0.2, Send2 0.35
master: MasterGain 1, P2Type Reverb, P2Return 0.35

